  "description": "Peace and nature are the only things Seyeon expects to enjoy while staying in the countryside with a family she knows. So she’s startled when she runs into the family’s son, Jeongwook, who was her childhood friend. The two of them haven’t seen each other since drifting apart in their teens, but that doesn’t stop Seyeon from checking out Jeongwook’s pecs. Once they catch each other in some suggestive situations, things heat up quickly between them. When the aloof Jeongwook suddenly confesses his feelings, it’s up to Seyeon to decide where to take their secret fling in the orchard…!\n\n*Source: Tappytoon*",
